  "The same stateless model call, reached through two interfaces. The Chat Completions API: you resend the full messages array each turn and your code keeps the history. The Responses API: you send only new input plus a reference, and the server keeps the thread. Both feed the same stateless model, which receives the full context and returns one assistant turn (content, finish_reason, usage). They differ only in who keeps the conversation between turns.": "通过两种接口访问同一个无状态模型调用。Chat Completions API：您需要在每一轮重新发送完整的 messages 数组，并由代码保存历史记录。Responses API：您只需发送新输入和一个引用，由服务器保存会话线程。两者都会将内容传给同一个无状态模型；该模型接收完整上下文并返回一轮助手响应（content、finish_reason、usage）。两者的唯一区别是由谁在轮次之间保存对话。",
