  "usage": "usage",
  "The agent loop drawn locally as a cycle. Step one, locally-sample: read a slice of the environment. Step two, locally-perceive: render that slice into a full engineered text context. That context holds the system prompt, the message history, prior tool results, and the sampled slice, all of it as plain text. The context is fed as text into one stateless text-to-text mapping, the LLM, which is the only model in the picture; perceive-to-act is collapsed into that single mapping. Its output is an intent signal, a typed tool call, not the action itself. Step three, locally-act: your code translates the intent into one bounded local environment update. Step four, locally-impact: the update changes the world, and the next local sample reads the changed world. Every box except the model is code you wrote; the model never touches the world, it only emits an intent the loop chooses to honor.": "以本地循环形式绘制的智能体循环。第一步，locally-sample：读取一部分环境。第二步，locally-perceive：将这一部分渲染为完整的工程化文本上下文。该上下文包含系统提示词、消息历史记录、先前的工具结果以及采样片段，所有内容均为纯文本。上下文以文本形式输入一个无状态的文本到文本映射，即 LLM，它是图中唯一的模型；从感知到行动的过程被整合到这一映射中。模型输出的是意图信号，即一种带类型的工具调用，而非动作本身。第三步，locally-act：代码将意图转换为一次有明确边界的本地环境更新。第四步，locally-impact：该更新改变世界，下一次本地采样会读取变化后的世界。除模型外，每个框都代表您编写的代码；模型从不直接接触世界，只会发出意图，由循环决定是否执行。",
  "ENVIRONMENT · the only durable state": "环境 · 唯一的持久状态",
  "A maze cell, a chat transcript, a folder of files, a sandbox. The agent reads a slice and writes a slice.": "一个迷宫单元格、一份聊天记录、一个文件夹或一个沙箱。智能体读取其中一部分，并写入其中一部分。",
  "Nothing persists in the model between turns. Continuity lives here, in the context your code rebuilds.": "模型在轮次之间不会保留任何内容。连续性保存在此处，即代码重新构建的上下文中。",
