  "The general agent loop from Module 1a becomes the ReAct loop once the reasoning socket holds a language model. On the left, the general cycle: perception reads the world, a dashed swappable socket reasons, action changes the world. A bridge drops a language model into that socket. On the right, the same cycle driven by the model: it reasons, acts by calling a tool, and observes the tool's result, which re-enters the next reasoning step. Because the model works only in text, it reads a tool result in place of perceiving and emits a tool call to act.": "当推理插槽中装入语言模型时，模块 1a 中的通用智能体循环就会成为 ReAct 循环。左侧是通用循环：感知读取外部世界，虚线表示的可替换插槽负责推理，行动改变外部世界。通过桥接，将语言模型装入该插槽。右侧是由模型驱动的同一循环：模型进行推理，通过调用工具来行动，再观察工具结果，该结果随后进入下一步推理。由于模型只能处理文本，因此它以读取工具结果代替感知，并通过发出工具调用来行动。",
