  "Lilian Weng's 2023 map of an LLM agent. A language model sits at the center as the agent. Memory is above it (branching into short-term and long-term memory), Action is below, Tools are on the left (Calendar, Calculator, CodeInterpreter, Search, and more), and Planning is on the right (reflection, self-critique, chain of thought, subgoal decomposition). The model is the core controller; memory, planning, tools, and action are components wired around it.": "Lilian Weng 于 2023 年绘制的 LLM 智能体架构图。语言模型位于中心，充当智能体。上方是记忆（分为短期记忆和长期记忆），下方是行动，左侧是工具（日历、计算器、代码解释器、搜索等），右侧是规划（反思、自我批评、思维链、子目标分解）。模型是核心控制器；记忆、规划、工具和行动是连接在其周围的组件。",
