  "One turn of the ReAct loop as it runs in code. The model produces a Thought and either stops or requests a tool. On a tool request, the Action box runs your function and the Observation box appends the result to the messages array, then the loop returns to Thought. When finish_reason is stop, the turn exits to the final answer instead.": "ReAct 循环在代码中运行一轮的过程。模型生成一个思考结果，然后停止或请求工具。收到工具请求后，行动框运行函数，观察框将结果追加到 messages 数组，循环随后返回思考步骤。当 finish_reason 为 stop 时，本轮改为退出并生成最终答案。",
  "✓ final answer": "✓ 最终答案",
