  "Lost in the Middle, redrawn from Liu et al. 2023, mapped onto an agent's growing messages array. A U-shaped curve plots answer accuracy against where the needed text sits in the context. Accuracy is high at the start, where the system prompt is pinned, and at the end, where the latest tool result sits, but dips to its lowest in the middle. As the loop appends turns, the original request is pushed left from the fresh end into the weak middle, which is context rot.": "“Lost in the Middle”，根据 Liu et al. 2023 年的研究重绘，并映射到智能体不断增长的 messages 数组。U 形曲线展示答案准确率与所需文本在上下文中所处位置的关系。准确率在开头和末尾较高：开头固定着系统提示词，末尾则是最新的工具结果；而中间位置的准确率降至最低。随着循环不断追加轮次，原始请求会从末端的新近位置被向左推入薄弱的中间区域，这就是上下文退化。",
  "answer accuracy": "答案准确率",
