  "A RAG architecture split into two timelines. Timeline 1, indexing, runs offline: a knowledge base of documents is preprocessed, embedded by an embedding model, and stored in a vector database. Timeline 2, serving, runs live: a user query reaches a chat app, is embedded, matched against the vector database, and the retrieved context with the query goes to the LLM engine, which streams back a grounded response.": "一个分为两条时间线的 RAG 架构。时间线 1 为离线运行的索引构建：对文档知识库进行预处理，通过嵌入模型生成嵌入，并存储到向量数据库中。时间线 2 为实时运行的服务：用户查询进入聊天应用，生成嵌入后与向量数据库进行匹配；检索到的上下文连同查询一起发送至 LLM 引擎，由该引擎以流式方式返回有依据的响应。",
