  "The GraphRAG pipeline. Indexing, shown in blue, runs offline: source documents are split into text chunks, an LLM extracts entities and relationships into a knowledge graph, and community detection partitions it into communities. Query time, shown in green, runs per question: each community is summarized, the summaries produce partial community answers, and those answers are reduced into one global answer.": "GraphRAG 工作流。蓝色部分表示离线运行的索引构建：源文档被拆分为文本块，由 LLM 提取实体和关系并构建知识图谱，再通过社区检测将其划分为多个社区。绿色部分表示针对每个问题运行的查询阶段：先对各社区进行摘要，再根据摘要生成各社区的部分答案，最后归并为一个全局答案。",
